                                QUERY PLAN                                
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Aggregate
   ->  HashAggregate
         Group Key: bson_distinct_unwind(collection.document, 'st'::text)
         ->  ProjectSet
               ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on documents_8308 collection
                     Recheck Cond: (shard_key_value = '8308'::bigint)
                     ->  Bitmap Index Scan on _id_
                           Index Cond: (shard_key_value = '8308'::bigint)
